     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"color:rgb(51,51,51);line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\">Hello Stan Users,</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><span><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"color:windowtext;line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\">I am wondering if STAN allows\r\nragged array assignment of matrices. And if yes, can someone help me with a\r\ncode to do this.<span>  </span>For instance, I have my\r\nsample data attached. I would like to compare “myears” within each woman (“matid’) (\r\ni.e. fit a Gaussian process for each “matid”), where each woman has different number\r\nof pregnancies (“preg”). <span> </span>Below <span> </span>is my simple code (partly adopted from stan manual\r\non fitting Gaussian process) but when I try to run it, the first error I get is:</span></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">“expression\r\ndenoting integer required; found type=int[]</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">ERROR\r\nat line 16</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">14:</font><span><font color=\"#000000\">   \r\n</font></span><font color=\"#000000\">real&lt;lower=0&gt; eta;</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">15:</font><span><font color=\"#000000\">   \r\n</font></span><font color=\"#000000\">real Beta; // residual variance</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">16:</font><span><font color=\"#000000\">   \r\n</font></span><font color=\"#000000\">matrix[rws,cls] Sigma_gp[N];//ragged matrices for the gaussian process”</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 10pt\"><span style=\"line-height:115%;font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">##\r\ncode##</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">data{</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int&lt;lower=1&gt;\r\nNobs; // number of observations</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int&lt;lower=1&gt;\r\nN; // number subjects</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">vector[Nobs]\r\nmyears; // time in years at birth</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int&lt;lower=1&gt;\r\npreg[N,Nobs];// pregancy ID</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int&lt;lower=1&gt;\r\nmxpreg[N]; // maximum number of pregnancies per woman</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int&lt;lower=1&gt;\r\ncls[N]; //Number of columns per each ragged matrix</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int&lt;lower=1&gt;\r\nrws[N];//Number of rows per each ragged matrix</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">//\r\nwhere, cls=rws=mxpreg</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">}</font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">parameters{</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">real&lt;lower=0&gt;\r\nsigma_e; // residual variance</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">real&lt;lower=0&gt;\r\neta;</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">real\r\nBeta; // residual variance</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">matrix[rws,cls]\r\nSigma_gp[N];//ragged matrices for the gaussian process</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">}</font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">model{</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">int\r\nc;</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">for(i\r\nin 1:N){</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">c[i]&lt;-mxpreg[i];</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">//\r\noff-diagonal elements</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">for\r\n(j in 1:c-1){</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">for (k in 2:c) {</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">   </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">Sigma_gp[i,j,k] &lt;-\r\nexp(-pow(myears[i,preg[i,j]]-myears[i,preg[i,k]], 2));</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">   </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">Sigma_gp[i,k,j] &lt;- Sigma_gp[i,j, k];</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">}</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">}</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">//\r\ndiagonal elements</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">  </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">for(l in 1:c) </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><span><font color=\"#000000\">  </font></span><font color=\"#000000\">Sigma_gp[i,l,l]&lt;- eta + sigma_e;</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span>  </span><span> </span></font><font color=\"#000000\">}</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">Beta\r\n~ normal(0,100);</font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><p style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"> </font></span></p><font color=\"#000000\" face=\"Times New Roman\" size=\"3\">\r\n\r\n</font><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">}\r\n</font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">I will be very grateful for your kind help.</font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">Thanks,</font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\"><br></font></span></div><div style=\"margin:0in 0in 0pt\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;;font-size:10pt\"><font color=\"#000000\">